### RouterLLM Smoke Tests
### =======================
### Set your auth key below if the server requires one (e.g. Authorization: Bearer <key>).
### Leave empty if the server is open / no proxy auth.
### Start the server first: go run ./cmd/routerllm

@baseUrl = http://localhost:1765
@auth = 

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List models
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/models

### --- /v1/chat/completions ---

### Chat completions — streaming (default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
{{auth}}

{
  "model": "my-model",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "Say hello in one word."}
  ],
  "stream": true
}

### Chat completions — non-streaming
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
{{auth}}

{
  "model": "my-model",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "Say hello in one word."}
  ]
}

### Chat completions — with reasoning effort
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
{{auth}}

{
  "model": "my-model",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "Solve 2+2 step by step"}
  ],
  "reasoning_effort": "high",
  "stream": true
}

### Chat completions — with system message and thinking
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
{{auth}}

{
  "model": "my-model",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant."},
    {"role": "user", "content": "Explain quantum computing in 3 sentences."}
  ],
  "stream": true
}

### --- /v1/messages (Anthropic-compatible) ---

### Messages — streaming (translated to OpenAI, then back to Anthropic SSE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
{{auth}}

{
  "model": "my-model",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "Say hello in one word."}
  ],
  "max_tokens": 1024,
  "stream": true
}

### Messages — with system prompt (Anthropic format)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
{{auth}}

{
  "model": "my-model",
  "system": "You are Claude, a helpful AI.",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "What is 2+2?"}
  ],
  "max_tokens": 500,
  "stream": true
}

### --- /v1/responses (OpenAI-only) ---

### Responses — streaming
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/responses
Content-Type: application/json
{{auth}}

{
  "model": "my-model",
  "input": "Say hello in one word.",
  "stream": true
}

### Responses — non-streaming
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/responses
Content-Type: application/json
{{auth}}

{
  "model": "my-model",
  "input": "Say hello in one word."
}

### --- Error cases ---

### Missing model
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
{{auth}}

{
  "model": "nonexistent-model",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "hi"}]
}

### Malformed body
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
{{auth}}

this is not json

### Empty messages
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
{{auth}}

{
  "model": "my-model",
  "messages": []
}
